    {
      "text": "6 Self Localization in Sensor Networks: Problem Formulation",
      "bbox": [
        46.48617172241211,
        511.04736328125,
        309.3772888183594,
        520.0535888671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A number n of sensors is randomly deployed in a planar region. Each sensor has noisy measurements of its distances",
      "bbox": [
        46.48617172241211,
        535.9498291015625,
        500.0115661621094,
        545.0755615234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "from neighboring sensors. The position of sensor t is denoted xt, t = 1, . . . , n. A small number of nodes (called",
      "bbox": [
        46.486167907714844,
        547.39990234375,
        500.0346984863281,
        558.4161987304688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "anchors) have signiﬁcant a priori information, pt(xt), about their positions. These sensors can be placed manually",
      "bbox": [
        46.486419677734375,
        559.8558959960938,
        500.0172424316406,
        570.8720703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "or can be equipped with a GPS module if manual placement is impractical. Two sensors are able to communicate if",
      "bbox": [
        46.485870361328125,
        573.3093872070312,
        500.0481262207031,
        582.4351196289062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the distance separating them is less than some maximum range denoted R. Let dts denote the noisy measurement",
      "bbox": [
        46.485870361328125,
        585.76513671875,
        500.015869140625,
        596.384765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of the distance between sensors s and t, then:",
      "bbox": [
        46.4864501953125,
        598.2213745117188,
        226.9898223876953,
        607.3471069335938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dts = ||xt −xs|| + vts, vts ∼pv(xt, xs),",
      "bbox": [
        46.48643493652344,
        614.2877807617188,
        214.17657470703125,
        625.7445068359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
