        624.4197387695312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where pv(xt, xs) refers to the noise probability distribution and || . || denotes the Euclidean distance between t and",
      "bbox": [
        46.486175537109375,
        631.3609008789062,
        500.0302429199219,
        642.377197265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "s. The binary random variable ots indicates whether the distance dts is observed or not. According to the assumption",
      "bbox": [
